"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"## RCA — runtime-confirmed (Phase 1 exit)\n\nProven at runtime by driving the REAL `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh` (current `origin/main`, unfixed) under a git shim where `main` advanced and `git diff` reports exactly ONE source changed, with `deployed-sha` reset per run.\n\n**Discriminating experiment (same source class, only manifest membership differs):**\n- `infra/gerrit/materialize-deploy-key.sh` changed → **NO signal** emitted; the tick logs \"deploy complete\" with no `AUTODEPLOY_ERROR`. → silent drift.\n- `infra/gerrit/materialize-g2p-config.sh` changed (its sibling, already in `CONFIG_PATHS`) → `AUTODEPLOY_ERROR {\"reason\":\"config_manual\", ...}` fires.\n\nBoth are SSM→file gerrit materializers of identical drift class; the only difference is that `materialize-g2p-config.sh` is enumerated in `CONFIG_PATHS` and `materialize-deploy-key.sh` is in **no** manifest.\n\n**Root cause (changeable artifact):** the omission of `infra/gerrit/materialize-deploy-key.sh` from the `CONFIG_PATHS` string literal in `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh`. `changed \"$CONFIG_PATHS\"` runs `git diff --name-only … -- $CONFIG_PATHS`; because the deploy-key path is not in that pathspec, its diff never names it, the config block never fires, and a merged change rsyncs to `/opt/rebar` and does nothing.\n\n**Disposition: DETECT-ONLY parity** with the rest of `CONFIG_PATHS` (applying touches gerrit — the same operator-judgement boundary; no auto-reload). Fix = add the path to `CONFIG_PATHS`; keep `reason=config_manual`.\n\n**Defect origin:** scope-of-work omission by story `8903-efb2-b73f-4e22` (gall-plume-adder, path-manifest deploy model); attributed via `caused_by=8903-efb2-b73f-4e22` at close. Handled as ONE class-level change with sibling `5d4c-a25b-b612-4aca` (broke-choleric-hound).","timestamp":1788119483328771594},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"## Verification evidence (for the [non-codebase] acceptance criteria)\n\nThese three criteria are run-results / process evidence that inherently live outside the repository snapshot; documenting the concrete artifacts here per the completion-verifier's evidence path.\n\n### RED→GREEN + mutation teeth (both instances)\n\nTests were authored held-out from the fixer and confirmed RED against the UNFIXED `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh` before the two manifest additions were applied.\n\n- Instance 1 — `tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_signals_gerrit_config.py`\n  - `test_autodeploy_signals_config_manual` parametrized over `_CONFIG_MANUAL_SOURCES = [(\"infra/compose/gerrit.config\",\"gerrit.config\"), (\"infra/gerrit/materialize-deploy-key.sh\", None)]`.\n  - RED before fix: the `materialize-deploy-key.sh` param produced NO `AUTODEPLOY_ERROR reason=config_manual` signal (path absent from `CONFIG_PATHS`); the `gerrit.config` param passed.\n  - GREEN after adding `infra/gerrit/materialize-deploy-key.sh` to `CONFIG_PATHS`: deploy-key-only change emits `AUTODEPLOY_ERROR reason=config_manual` + \"MANUAL operator apply\".\n  - Mutation teeth: emptying the `CONFIG_PATHS` entry → back to RED; restoring → GREEN.\n\n- Instance 2 — `tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_mcp_bluegreen.py`\n  - `test_entrypoint_source_change_rebuilds_the_mcp_image` drives the real `autodeploy.sh` under a git shim where ONLY `infra/scripts/mcp-entrypoint.sh` changed.\n  - RED before fix: no mcp deploy, 0 `docker compose build mcp` (path absent from `MCP_PATHS`).\n  - GREEN after adding `infra/scripts/mcp-entrypoint.sh` to `MCP_PATHS`: existing blue-green mcp deploy path fires — `docker compose build mcp` invoked + nginx upstream flipped.\n  - Mutation teeth: emptying the `MCP_PATHS` entry → back to RED; restoring → GREEN.\n\n### `make lint` (incl. shellcheck)\n\n`make lint` PASSED locally in the worktree (ruff check + format-check + shellcheck over `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh`). Independently re-run by CI: the `build-and-test / lint + type-check` job of GitHub Actions run 33333127540 succeeded, contributing to `Verified +1` on Gerrit change 2444.\n\n### Full `tests/scripts` suite\n\nFull local run: **1313 passed, 3 skipped**. Independently re-run by CI: the `pytest` matrix jobs (ubuntu py3.11/3.12/3.13, macos py3.13) of run 33333127540 all succeeded, contributing to `Verified +1` on change 2444.\n\n### Landing\n\nGerrit change 2444 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/2444) — `LLM-Review +1` AND `Verified +1`, 0 unresolved comments — **MERGED** to `main`. Commit `27ac63f7c4392ae88203fff9ee38d1bdca9e0307` carries `rebar-ticket: 408c-9c78-c523-4d1c` and mentions both ids (408c + 5d4c) in the body.","timestamp":1788123789152428700}],"created_at":1788116404662070714,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"4685e534-5101-48d7-ab23-93dee89a531f","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"5524-e353-2e2d-4dbe"},{"link_uuid":"584a2075-902c-440e-8bf0-69da73af3bf8","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"846c-96a8-166a-450e"}],"description":"## Summary\n\nFound by the Step 7 (Axis 1 construct) sibling sweep while fixing `satiated-activated-aardwolf` (5524-e353-2e2d-4dbe). Same detect-only drift class as `CONFIG_PATHS`, but on the gerrit deploy-key materializer, which was overlooked when `materialize-g2p-config.sh` was added to `CONFIG_PATHS`.\n\n`infra/gerrit/materialize-deploy-key.sh` is an SSM-to-file materializer (it puts the replication deploy key into the gerrit user's dir), a direct sibling of `infra/gerrit/materialize-g2p-config.sh`. `materialize-g2p-config.sh` IS enumerated in `CONFIG_PATHS` (detect-only, `reason=config_manual`); `materialize-deploy-key.sh` is in **no** manifest. So a merged change to the deploy-key materializer rsyncs to `/opt/rebar` and silently does nothing — the same drift class `CONFIG_PATHS` detect-only was created to make visible.\n\n## Class-level plan (PRIMARY ticket for the manifest-omission class)\n\nThis ticket is the primary for a ONE class-level change fixing both confirmed instances of the class \"an infra SOURCE that affects the running environment is absent from every path manifest in `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh`, so a merged change to it drifts silently\". The change touches ONLY `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh` (two manifest additions) plus the new/extended regression tests. Sibling ticket `5d4c-a25b-b612-4aca` (broke-choleric-hound) is fixed in the same change.\n\nBoth instances proven at runtime with a discriminating contrast against the sibling source that IS in the manifest (see RCA comments on each ticket).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] `infra/gerrit/materialize-deploy-key.sh` is enumerated in the `CONFIG_PATHS` literal in `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh` (Instance 1, detect-only parity with `materialize-g2p-config.sh`; applying touches gerrit so no auto-reload).\n- [x] A deploy-key-materializer-only change emits `AUTODEPLOY_ERROR reason=config_manual`, asserted by a regression test extending `tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_signals_gerrit_config.py`.\n- [x] `infra/scripts/mcp-entrypoint.sh` is enumerated in the `MCP_PATHS` literal in `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh` (Instance 2, apply-parity; ADR 0079 v1 mcp auto-apply scope).\n- [x] An mcp-entrypoint-source-only change fires the existing blue-green mcp deploy path, asserted by a regression test in `tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_mcp_bluegreen.py` (`docker compose build mcp` invoked + nginx upstream flipped).\n- [x] [non-codebase] Each regression test is shown RED before the fix and GREEN after, with mutation teeth: emptying the manifest entry returns the test to RED. (Process/run evidence — see the RED→GREEN + mutation-teeth comment on this ticket.)\n- [x] [non-codebase] `make lint` (including shellcheck) passes. (Run result — see the verification-evidence comment; also the Gerrit `Verified +1` lint+type-check job on change 2444.)\n- [x] [non-codebase] The full `tests/scripts` suite passes. (Run result — see the verification-evidence comment; also the Gerrit `Verified +1` pytest jobs on change 2444.)\n\n## Non-goals\n\n- `observability.sh` needs no change: it already counts every `AUTODEPLOY_ERROR {` marker regardless of `reason`, so the `config_manual` signal is counted for free.\n- A structural manifest-completeness guard for this class is being evaluated separately and is intentionally out of scope. Any further same-class instances found are enumerated in the final report, not filed, per the sweep-containment directive.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `CONFIG_PATHS` includes `infra/gerrit/materialize-g2p-config.sh` but NOT `infra/gerrit/materialize-deploy-key.sh`.\n- Runtime discriminating experiment: a deploy-key-materializer-only change produced NO signal; a g2p-materializer-only change produced `AUTODEPLOY_ERROR reason=config_manual`.\n- `infra/compose/Dockerfile.mcp` bakes `mcp-entrypoint.sh` into the image (`install -m 0755 ... mcp-entrypoint.sh /usr/local/bin/mcp-entrypoint.sh`; `ENTRYPOINT`), yet it is absent from `MCP_PATHS`.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh","reason":"Instance 1: add infra/gerrit/materialize-deploy-key.sh to CONFIG_PATHS (detect-only, config_manual). Instance 2: add infra/scripts/mcp-entrypoint.sh to MCP_PATHS (apply-parity, existing blue-green mcp deploy). Two manifest-string additions only."},{"path":"infra/compose/docker-compose.yml","reason":"Sync the doc-comment MCP_PATHS mirror (the human-readable copy of MCP_PATHS carried in a comment) to include infra/scripts/mcp-entrypoint.sh so it does not drift from the authoritative manifest in autodeploy.sh. Addresses the plan-review/LLM-Review advisory about the mirror drifting. Comment-only, no runtime behavior change."},{"path":"tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_signals_gerrit_config.py","reason":"Instance 1 RED->GREEN: extend to assert AUTODEPLOY_ERROR reason=config_manual on a materialize-deploy-key.sh-only change, mirroring the existing gerrit.config signal test."},{"path":"tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_mcp_bluegreen.py","reason":"Instance 2 RED->GREEN: add a test that drives autodeploy under a git shim where only infra/scripts/mcp-entrypoint.sh changed and asserts the existing mcp blue-green deploy path fires (compose build mcp + upstream flip)."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","managed_refs":[["relates_to","846c-96a8-166a-450e"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"4f019f77-fbfc-4586-b6be-2bf1d2cb09fc","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"408c-9c78-c523-4d1c","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Autodeploy never signals a materialize-deploy-key.sh source change — gerrit deploy-key materializer absent from CONFIG_PATHS (detect-only silent-drift sibling of 5524)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["64aa4933-803d-4645-bd88-160fd3a4fb04","4685e534-5101-48d7-ab23-93dee89a531f","4f019f77-fbfc-4586-b6be-2bf1d2cb09fc","9981fd5d-01ee-4f4f-ae8b-88fe41528859","eecc0bf7-6133-418d-92f7-df7aa0560d76","c7741e55-aa43-4346-a93d-727806cbec6a","0135f2f2-4728-4f1c-a332-5b91469dcf5f","70be7753-ff8e-4fc3-9ff6-8a7068a46b0e","fb212dd1-d4f2-4916-a99a-20737c80b038","584a2075-902c-440e-8bf0-69da73af3bf8","1f4edab0-144b-4a67-8d06-7f56412a57e0","fe6d439f-94df-4988-9ffa-197eb490ad97","467bfbeb-f87e-4782-aa4b-9c6a0ea745e8","e459a19d-e2a2-476b-8540-dce20634457e","6430b84f-4457-46a5-ade9-495c54e0e6f8","c437fc98-476a-4912-ab1a-87f7c71650da"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":178